-- EL NASS MESH NFC ------------------------------------ main.franco.kl  SEC0101

La2eit U+0301 (COMBINING ACUTE ACCENT) f kalam mesh b sheklo el NFC f Unicode. Nafs el 7arf momken yetkhezen code point wa7ed, aw 7arf asasi w ba3do 3alamat murakkaba; el etnein shabah ba3d bel zabt, bas lamma tqarenhom yetle3o mokhtalfeen.

2│     khali name = "Zoé"
                       ^^

Garrab: `é`

Mosa3da: Shaghal `kalam fmt` aw `kalam fix`, hayekteb el kalam b NFC w mesh hayghayar ay 7aga tanya.

E3raf aktar: kalam explain SEC0101
